title:
Helper type for {@link UiSdlIconCell} to define a conditional icon with a JavaScript
expression. `value` in #expression can be used as the value at fieldPath in dataItem.
E.g., if the following expression passed, the indicator would be "circle".

```json
{
  "expression": "value > 10",
  "iconConfig": {
     "icon": "circle"
  }
}
```
